        "category": "status",
        "predicate": [],
        "description": "<p>Trigger: The user is targeted by an Attack.</p><p>Effect: The triggering Attack fails to hit the user and all other creatures targeted by the Attack. Attacks failing to hit this way do not activate their secondary effects.</p><p>If the triggering Attack has @Trait[contact], the user may then freely use @UUID[Compendium.ptr2e.core-moves.Item.FmOD0al3Z9cH3B7h.Actions.massif-rebuke]{Massif Rebuke}, targeting the triggering creature. If the triggering Attack does not have @Trait[contact], the triggering creature is @Affliction[delay 40] while the user gains @UUID[Compendium.ptr2e.core-effects.XeiSuS3APUcN0MLM]{+1 SPD} and @UUID[Compendium.ptr2e.core-effects.OUBNweJOMjAEtAye]{EVA} Stage for 7 Activations and may freely move up to half of the Movement Allowance of their choice.</p><p>This Attack is then @Affliction[disabled 2].</p>",
        "range": {
          "target": "self",
          "unit": "m"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "Massif Rebuke",
        "slug": "massif-rebuke",
        "description": "<p>Trigger: Triggered by the effect of Massif Refute.</p><p>Effect: The user ignores any @Trait[defensive] and @Trait[stage-change] effects the target has for this attack’s use. On hit, the target gains @Affliction[frostbite 7] and @Affliction[splinter 7].</p>",
